ly managed to help fend off Yhwach's fearsome wrath. However, to ultimately defeat his godly adversary and save his allies, Ichigo must now undergo severe training that will push him beyond his physical, emotional, and mental limits.\n\nThough Yhwach already holds the upper hand in this ongoing blood feud, he also successfully recruits Uryuu Ishida, Ichigo's close friend and rival, to be his successor. Yhwach strikes out once again at the weakened Soul Society, intent on finally obliterating his long-standing enemies. As Ichigo struggles to attain new power, the Soul Reaper captains fight for survival and borrowed time.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shounen","rank":99,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mythology","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Afterlife","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Gore","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Zombie","rank":50,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Ghost","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Transgender","rank":42,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Femboy","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":33,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Gender Bending","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":12,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War - The Separation","english":"BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War - The Separation","native":"BLEACH 千年血戦篇-訣別譚-","romaji":"BLEACH: Sennen Kessen-hen - Ketsubetsu-tan","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"死神 千年血战篇-诀别谭-"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Bleach: Sennen Kessen Hen - Ketsubetsu Tan"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"死神 千年血战篇 第2部分"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"死神 千年血战篇 Pa